Package: montyhall
Title: Simulate the Monty Hall Problem
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Alissa", "Power", , "almowrey@asu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for simulating the Monty Hall problem.
    The package allows users to create a game, select and open doors,
    apply stay or switch strategies, determine game outcomes, and run
    repeated simulations to compare strategies.
Depends:
    dplyr
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
